OL,3,GNEWSAI was fired from The Voice - I
OL,4,Adidn't want to leave, says Sir Tom
OL,5,AJones
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Tom Jones has said he did not want
OL,8,Fto leave The Voice, saying he "loves
OL,9,Fthe show" and ITV made the decision to
OL,10,F"fire" him from the judging panel.
OL,12,FThe Welsh singer, 86, has appeared as
OL,13,Fan on-off coach on the singing
OL,14,Fcompetition since it premiered in 2012.
OL,16,FFollowing rumours that he may not
OL,17,Freturn to the panel for the upcoming
OL,18,Fseries, Sir Tom said the broadcaster
OL,19,Fdecided a while ago and "I was told
OL,20,Frecently".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
