OL,3,GNEWSAI was fired from The Voice - I
OL,4,Adidn't want to leave, says Sir Tom
OL,5,AJones
OL,6,
OL,7,FITV has been asked to comment, but the
OL,8,FPress Association reported that a
OL,9,Fsource at the show was "hopeful" the
OL,10,Fsinger would return for its upcoming
OL,11,Fseries.
